OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fgradually ease this evening, leading
OL,7,Fto a largely dry night across the
OL,8,Fregion. Clearer skies will bring a
OL,9,Fchilly night, especially in rural
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA dry, bright day with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and patches of fair weather
OL,14,Fcloud. After a cool start,
OL,15,Ftemperatures will rise to around
OL,16,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
